{{Term/Store|Hylian Tunic|Hylian Tunics|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Hylian Tunics are pieces of [[Armor]] that can be purchased at [[Enchanted]] in [[Kakariko Village]] and at the [[Ventest Clothing Boutique]] in [[Hateno Village]]. They can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Hylian Tunic, alongside the [[Hylian Hood]] and [[Hylian Trousers]], compose the [[Hylian Armor Series]]. The Tunic itself is composed of a cuirass, a spaulder, and a pair of gloves and bracers, all made from leather.

